{"parentUuid":"7b831e6a-8371-4861-8677-2401c0497eb9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"eb6cbe51-8dc5-48b8-b7ae-d7d6e1fb6b02","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014i9hVZd1uCD6nkjeRK34v9","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"OpenRouter Responses API streaming \"[DONE]\" data line /api/v1/responses\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Basic Usage\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.ai/docs/api-reference/responses-api/basic-usage\"},{\"title\":\"> ## Documentation Index\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.ai/docs/api_reference/responses/basic-usage.md\"},{\"title\":\"basic usage\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.ai/docs/api/reference/responses/basic-usage\"},{\"title\":\"> ## Documentation Index\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter.helicone.ai/docs/api/api-reference/responses/create-a-response.md\"},{\"title\":\"> ## Documentation Index\",\"url\":\"https://api.ifq.ai/docs/api_reference/responses/basic-usage.md\"},{\"title\":\"Basic Usage\",\"url\":\"https://openrouter-gw-kz.just-ai.com/docs/api/reference/responses/basic-usage\"},{\"title\":\"Basic Usage\",\"url\":\"https://api.ifq.ai/docs/api/reference/responses/basic-usage\"}]\n\nThe OpenRouter docs confirm that the `/api/v1/responses` endpoint uses `[DONE]` as an end-of-stream sentinel, though the examples differ in how they show it.\n\n- **Sentinel handling:** The TypeScript and Python examples check for a `data: ` line whose payload is `[DONE]` and stop reading there, skipping any payload that isn't valid JSON. (Source: openrouter.ai basic-usage page, index 1-2 and 3-1.)\n- **Spec reference:** The OpenAPI definition for the create-response operation marks `[DONE]` as the SSE sentinel for the streaming schema. (Source: openrouter.helicone.ai create-a-response page, index 4-1.)\n- **Example output:** One docs page lists `data: [DONE]` as the final line of its streaming example, after the `response.done` event. (Source: openrouter.ai basic-usage page, index 1-2 and index 3-1.)\n- **Caveat:** The Responses API is labeled beta and may have breaking changes, so the sentinel behavior could change. (Source: openrouter.ai basic-usage page, index 1-1.)\n\nI found no source describing any edge cases around `[DONE]` beyond these examples.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"baf88a9d-ffcd-47b1-96e5-59cdf37dc2af","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:11:07.698Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"OpenRouter Responses API streaming \"[DONE]\" data line /api/v1/responses","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Ue4CESzYJp1yV21M56osa3","content":[{"title":"Basic Usage","url":"https://openrouter.ai/docs/api-reference/responses-api/basic-usage"},{"title":"> ## Documentation Index","url":"https://openrouter.ai/docs/api_reference/responses/basic-usage.md"},{"title":"basic usage","url":"https://openrouter.ai/docs/api/reference/responses/basic-usage"},{"title":"> ## Documentation Index","url":"https://openrouter.helicone.ai/docs/api/api-reference/responses/create-a-response.md"},{"title":"> ## Documentation Index","url":"https://api.ifq.ai/docs/api_reference/responses/basic-usage.md"},{"title":"Basic Usage","url":"https://openrouter-gw-kz.just-ai.com/docs/api/reference/responses/basic-usage"},{"title":"Basic Usage","url":"https://api.ifq.ai/docs/api/reference/responses/basic-usage"}]},"The OpenRouter docs confirm that the `/api/v1/responses` endpoint uses `[DONE]` as an end-of-stream sentinel, though the examples differ in how they show it.\n\n- **Sentinel handling:** The TypeScript and Python examples check for a `data: ` line whose payload is `[DONE]` and stop reading there, skipping any payload that isn't valid JSON. (Source: openrouter.ai basic-usage page, index 1-2 and 3-1.)\n- **Spec reference:** The OpenAPI definition for the create-response operation marks `[DONE]` as the SSE sentinel for the streaming schema. (Source: openrouter.helicone.ai create-a-response page, index 4-1.)\n- **Example output:** O