{"parentUuid":"59edee2b-da55-4e83-8075-86c5512169ee","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"instructions","files":[{"path":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory/MEMORY.md","type":"AutoMem","content":"- [Before running or concluding](evidence-before-handing-kenneth-a-decision.md) — **write the question and who holds the answer first: search, logs, one observation; experiments last.**\n- [Trace a rule to Kenneth's words](trace-a-rule-to-kenneths-words.md) — briefs reword rules stricter; find his words and why before saying \"your rule\".\n- [POC branch](jusprin-v2-poc-rebase-not-merge.md) — rebase the fork's commits, never merge.\n- [Rebase risk](fork-rebase-risk-verify-before-claiming.md) — three checks before claiming it.\n- [Shell phase 1](jusprin-shell-phase-1-design.md) — hide the tab strip, don't reparent Plater.\n- [Teardown crash](orca-inherited-teardown-crash.md) — exit segfault in ~GLCanvas3D; inherited.\n- [Worktree build](jusprin-worktree-build.md) — configure line reusing deps; use /Applications/CMake.app.\n- [Bridge phase 2](agent-bridge-phase-2.md) — page, protocol locations; bundle rebuild rule.; [Bridge phase 3](agent-bridge-phase-3.md) — ToolExecutionCoordinator, staleness, idempotency.; [Bridge phase 4](agent-bridge-phase-4.md) — persistence, aux-dir healing, checkpoint traps.; [Bridge phase 5](agent-bridge-phase-5.md) — attachments: blob storage, revert copy-forward.\n- [Protocol version](protocol-version-only-at-compat-boundary.md) — no bump; use capabilities.\n- [Wall-clock](track-wall-clock-on-background-work.md) — check long tasks really progress.\n- [API-key setup](agent-setup-api-key-path.md) — verification is construction; no project data in probe.\n- [Live-test on Mac](live-test-built-app-on-mac.md) — shared bundle id; second monitor; launch with open -n.\n- [zsh $VAR:path](zsh-var-colon-path-trap.md) — write `${U}:path` or git refs get mangled.\n- [Bash cwd resets](bash-cwd-resets-after-background.md) —