{"parentUuid":"58eb572b-5eac-4915-80dd-d2ebb38bab80","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fc150b4b-721c-4e12-bf4a-d2a62eef7031","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WNkDoHbiL5ZaTAsjwsuvyX","type":"tool_result","content":"172\tand tool rounds the sitting had.\n173\t\n174\t**Branches.** In some cases the newest request does *not* extend the previous\n175\tone:\n176\t- the person reverts to a checkpoint\n177\t- the person retries a turn (`attempt-2`)\n178\t- the person edits an earlier message\n179\t- the chat id collides after a project copy\n180\t\n181\tThen the old version is a branch that would be lost by overwriting, and a\n182\tdiscarded attempt is useful training signal (it shows what the person\n183\trejected). So before overwriting, the gateway checks the old version:\n184\t- The buffered record keeps a hash of each message.\n185\t- If the new request's messages don't start with the stored ones, the old\n186\t  record is first written straight to GCS as\n187\t  `<user_id>/<chat id>/branch-<timestamp>.json.gz`.\n188\t\n189\tOnly the message array is compared. The system prompt changes every turn,\n190\tbecause it carries the project's current state.\n191\t\n192\t**What a record holds:**\n193\t"}]},"uuid":"a3ede6c1-2b3b-41b5-9671-61d09c055f78","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:31:26.302Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise/jusprin-v2-chat-capture-design.md","content":"and tool rounds the sitting had.\n\n**Branches.** In some cases the newest request does *not* extend the previous\none:\n- the person reverts to a checkpoint\n- the person retries a turn (`attempt-2`)\n- the person edits an earlier message\n- the chat id collides after a project copy\n\nThen the old version is a branch that would be lost by overwriting, and a\ndiscarded attempt is useful training signal (it shows what the person\nrejected). So before overwriting, the gateway checks the old version:\n- The buffered record keeps a hash of each message.\n- If the new request's messages don't start with the stored ones, the old\n  record is first written straight to GCS as\n  `<user_id>/<chat id>/branch-<timestamp>.json.gz`.\n\nOnly the message array is compared. The system prompt changes every turn,\nbecause it carries the project's current state.\n\n**What a record holds:**\n","numLines":22,"startLine":172,"totalLines":308}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"58eb572b-5eac-4915-80dd-d2ebb38bab80","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
{"parentUuid":"a3ede6c1-2b3b-41b5-9671-61d09c055f78","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeRMpN9bC3Anzj4XfH2a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LzzVGz5bNnZfpu87ugKmET","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise/jusprin-v2-chat-capture-design.md","offset":266,"limit":14},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3054,"cache_read_input_tokens":224917,"output_tokens":883,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":625},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3054,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":883,"cache_read_input_tokens":224917,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3054,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3054},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LzzVGz5bNnZfpu87ugKmET":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise/jusprin-v2-chat-capture-design.md","offset":266,"limit":14}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgeRMojwg7yLtb6uKf18C","requestRef":"b93f1167-ea3d-4213-bc1e-fa1b9c857f60","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"341ef7f4-9683-4f26-bc95-f79a7b37342f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:31:26.925Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
{"parentUuid":"341ef7f4-9683-4f26-bc95-f79a7b37342f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fc150b4b-721c-4e12-bf4a-d2a62eef7031","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LzzVGz5bNnZfpu87ugKmET","type":"tool_result","content":"266\t\n267\t**Decided 2026-10-29: keep records until the person opts out or deletes their\n268\taccount, with no age limit and no lifecycle rule.**\n269\t\n270\t## Not captured, worth adding later\n271\t\n272\tFine-tuning data is far more useful with outcomes attached:\n273\t- did the person revert the agent's change\n274\t- did the slice succeed\n275\t- did the print succeed\n276\t\n277\tReverts and retries will now show as branches. Slice and print results still\n278\tneed a small event from the app, keyed by the chat id.\n279\t"}]},"uuid":"03a218a3-bdb3-470d-b631-62c0c808f1e4","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:31:26.952Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise/jusprin-v2-chat-capture-design.md","content":"\n**Decided 2026-10-29: keep records until the person opts out or deletes their\naccount, with no age limit and no lifecycle rule.**\n\n## Not captured, worth adding later\n\nFine-tuning data is far more useful with outcomes attached:\n- did the person revert the agent's change\n- did the slice succeed\n- did the print succeed\n\nReverts and retries will now show as branches. Slice and print results still\nneed a small event from the app, keyed by the chat id.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":266,"totalLines":308}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"341ef7f4-9683-4f26-bc95-f79a7b37342f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
