e parsed messages to detect branches. It only deletes far more than it adds if branch-keeping goes too. No files changed.","ask":"Should the blind write also remove branch-keeping?","actions":[{"label":"Keep branches","message":"Keep branch-keeping. Store raw text in _keep_sync, parse only in capture.keep for the branch check, and add the [DONE] test."},{"label":"Remove branches too","message":"Remove branch-keeping too. Make the whole write blind and delete the hash and branch code and its tests, accepting that retried, edited and reverted versions are overwritten."}],"blocked":true}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgeRNUS8CrewrCAa76QrZ","requestRef":"c39cee74-b7f2-41cf-a277-e3b5bb079449","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"81f2019d-4f22-4774-af7d-5ae9f119d28b","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:31:30.606Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
