{"parentUuid":"7026b564-bcb9-43ba-a229-3bde7756154f","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"output_style","style":"Plain"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fb8b740c-0355-481b-a61e-bd21af0101c6","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:36:02.879Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nPlain output style is active. Remember to follow the specific guidelines for this style.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise/.claude/worktrees/credits-ledger","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","hash":"a3b475f1f31c33c97d61fdc5690196c449446a07b8cf5666a504616992617cde","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fp6KNd9npEdotMf1dBi9MT","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory/jusprin-chat-capture-design.md","old_string":"- **Retention:** kept until the person opts out or deletes their account; no age limit.\n","new_string":"- **Retention:** kept until the person deletes their account; no age limit.\n- **Blind write, no branches (2026-11-02):** `_keep_sync` stores the request and reply events as raw text, and a retry, edit or revert overwrites the earlier version. Kenneth chose this over keeping branch files, knowing rejected attempts are lost. `[json.loads(data) for data in self.events]` had thrown on OpenRouter's `data: [DONE]`, losing every Standard chat. Uncommitted in the tsd-enterprise `credits-ledger` worktree until committed. The design doc's Branches section is out of date.\n\nState on 2026-11-02: 906752ee3e is on origin/master and origin/release. No deployment's `env` on the clusters names `JUSPRIN_V2_CAPTURE_CONTAINER`, and neither does the ops repo, so capture looks off; a value from a secret via `envFrom` was not checked.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013ySjz2ei3WWpbCtPG3p4Fs","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory/jusprin-chat-capture-design.md","old_string":" Nothing pushed or deployed.** Originally","new_string":"** Originally"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UUeeTkHZvbx6F5fTvg661Z","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_756f4482-e5c7-45b4-bc36-5e6db3b079ef/credits-onboarding-flags.md","old_string":"- Not fixed. The gateway logs \"could not keep a chat request\" for every Standard request through OpenRouter, with `JSONDecodeError: Expecting value: line 1 column 2`, the error `json.loads('[DONE]')` gives. `_collect` in `web_ent/jusprin/v2/gateway.py` (committed in 906752ee3e) parses every event as JSON. The chat still works; those requests are not kept. That OpenRouter sends `[DONE]` is inferred from the error text; the stream itself was not read.","new_string":"- Fixed, uncommitted in the `credits-ledger` worktree. The gateway logged \"could not keep a chat request\" for every Standard request through OpenRouter, because `_keep_sync` in `web_ent/jusprin/v2/gateway.py` parsed every reply event as JSON and OpenRouter's documented stream ends in `data: [DONE]`. Kenneth chose a blind write: the request and events are stored as raw text, and branch files are gone, so a retry, edit or revert overwrites the earlier version. A test with a stream ending in `[DONE]` failed before the change and passes now; all 122 `jusprin.v2` tests pass. The real OpenRouter stream was not rerun."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01H8eRS44zDDDkZSJ95d7og7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"M=/Users/kenneth/.claude/projects/-Users-kenneth-Projects-JusPrin/memory/MEMORY.md; grep -n \"jusprin-chat-capture-design\" $M | cut -c1-120; python3 - \"$M\" <<'PY'\nimport sys\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p).read()\na='[Chat capture](jusprin-chat-capture-design.md) — every chat kept, no opt-out; vendor terms open.'\nassert a in s\ns=s.replace(a,'[Chat capture](jusprin-chat-capture-design.md) — every chat kept raw, no opt-out, no branches; vendor terms open.')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\ncd /Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise/.claude/worktrees/credits-ledger; git status --short | grep -c . ; git log -1 --format=%h; pgrep -fl \"server.py 8791\" | wc -l","description":"Update the memory index line and confirm nothing was committed","timeout":15000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UfVNsZsUTiGiv4cirxUP7Z","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"done":[3],"start":4},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
