{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","id":"520abb4b-e742-4d64-8dc9-34304c7a63ca","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:36:04.577Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"8d45efdc67b5065b826b225c6fae0a4acb4aba598709c43f8feaca22fa764775","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"0f874557-8347-4b6b-84d6-2976c069bca6","keep":140,"tail":["3b066e8ad7514cf5206ed0cea3ec3f1bf79ad60d6bbc020f4a00cf4273ce1365","3a6b7d98c11e47521f2fad2e38cf0554fe69f44e2a362f4e1fd9ba27b3efbbc7","8d5417819870814c986d7076932ad2dcad28287bdd05a674772b4c6ce5fb42e5"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",142,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"15a5b1a1d0477aae67bdb7ef5cccbfb30fa96dbca367ab76acd812b3601faf95"}
{"parentUuid":"d8f2e4af-e3a8-49a3-8704-68d462ccfe25","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeRiwkk7G1s7YrCD7P8y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The gateway now keeps chats as a blind write and branch-keeping is gone, so a Standard chat ending in `data: [DONE]` is saved instead of lost. It's uncommitted in the tsd-enterprise `credits-ledger` worktree, alongside the credits work there.\n\n**What changed**\n- **`_keep_sync` in `gateway.py`:** it stores the request and the reply events as the text they came in, with no parsing.\n- **`capture.keep` in `capture.py`:** it no longer parses anything or compares messages. A retry, an edit or a revert now overwrites the earlier version of the chat.\n- **Removed:** the message hashing, the comparison that detected a changed chat, the branch files, and their tests.\n\n**Lines changed:** this time your expectation holds.\n\n| | Added | Deleted |\n|---|---|---|\n| `capture.py` | 11 | 57 |\n| `gateway.py` | 3 | 4 |\n| `test_capture.py` (about) | 21 | 37 |\n| **Total (about)** | **35** | **98** |\n\n**Tests:** the new test, whose fake stream ends in `data: [DONE]`, failed on the old code because the chat was never saved. It passes now, and all 122 `jusprin.v2` tests pass. I also added a test that a retried turn overwrites the earlier version, with no second file.\n\n**Not tested:** I didn't rerun the real OpenRouter stream, since that's a paid call you haven't approved. The test relies on OpenRouter's documented `[DONE]` ending.\n\n**Things to know**\n- **Stored format:** `request` is now a text string and `events` a list of strings, so whatever later builds fine-tuning data must parse them. I left `schema` at 1, because nothing reads these records and capture looks off.\n- **Capture in production:** no deployment on the clusters I could read names `JUSPRIN_V2_CAPTURE_CONTAINER` in its `env`, and neither does the `ops` repo. I couldn't read the `yumi` cluster, and I didn't check for a value supplied from a secret, so this isn't proof.\n- **Lost for good:** rejected attempts and earlier versions of a chat are no longer saved, as you chose. The final chat shows the retry or edit that replaced them, but not the version that was thrown away.\n- **Out-of-date doc:** the Branches section of `jusprin-v2-chat-capture-design.md` no longer matches the code. I left that untracked doc alone and noted this in my memory file about the capture.\n\nI stopped the test services I had started."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":241,"cache_read_input_tokens":250569,"output_tokens":846,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":241,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":846,"cache_read_input_tokens":250569,"cache_creation_input_tokens":241,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":241},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgeRiwLwLq8vAvLY6ecMh","requestRef":"520abb4b-e742-4d64-8dc9-34304c7a63ca","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"032e0891-5207-421c-b908-f413a24e48f3","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:36:12.141Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise/.claude/worktrees/credits-ledger","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
