ic\", \"label\": \"Standard\", \"tier\": \"basic\", \"credits\": 1,\n       \"efforts\": [\"fast\", \"thorough\"], \"default_effort\": \"fast\",\n+      \"backends\": {\n+        \"responses\": {\n+          \"base_url\": \"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\", \"model\": \"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash\",\n+          \"api_key_env\": \"JUSPRIN_OPENROUTER_API_KEY\",\n+          \"effort_map\": {\"fast\": \"low\", \"thorough\": \"high\"},\n+          \"images\": false\n+        }\n+      },\n+      \"groups\": [{\"name\": \"responses-main\", \"format\": \"responses\", \"percent\": 100}]\n+    }, {\n+      \"id\": \"slicer-1\", \"label\": \"Expert\", \"tier\": \"expert\", \"credits\": 5,\n+      \"efforts\": [\"fast\", \"thorough\"], \"default_effort\": \"thorough\",\n       \"backends\": {\n         \"anthropic\": {\n           \"base_url\": \"https://api.anthropic.com/v1\", \"model\": \"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\ndiff --git a/tsd/stg/tsdws-stg.yaml b/tsd/stg/tsdws-stg.yaml\nindex 934d8b5..07ad0ee 100644\n--- a/tsd/stg/tsdws-stg.yaml\n+++ b/tsd/stg/tsdws-stg.yaml\n@@ -127,6 +127,11 @@ spec:\n             secretKeyRef:\n               name: jusprin-v2-gateway-stg\n               key: JUSPRIN_OPENAI_API_KEY\n+        - name: JUSPRIN_OPENROUTER_API_KEY\n+          valueFrom:\n+            secretKeyRef:\n+              name: jusprin-v2-gateway-stg\n+              key: JUSPRIN_OPENROUTER_API_KEY\n         # Same Langfuse project as tsdweb; the gateway logs one generation per request.\n         - name: LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY\n           value: 'sk-lf-d3e33e48-960a-4fc4-952a-f992e67987cd'\na3f6f37\nRelease obi.4052: Python 3.12 / Django 5.2 in staging and production\n\nobi.4052 is tsd-enterprise 7edf2085c0 on obico-server 52748ec8 (PR 1171:\nPython 3.12, Django 5.2, Pillow 13, django-oauth-toolkit 3.4.1,\ndjango-allauth 0.63.6), built on thespaghettidetective/web:base-1.19. It\nalso carries the JusPrin v2 prompt_cache_key and chat-capture commits.\n\nStaging (tsdweb, tsdws, tsdtasks, tsdbeat) and production (tsdweb, tsdws,\ntsdtasks, tsdrttasks) run it. tsdbeat-prod stays on obi.4036.\n\nProduction migrations ran once from a one-off obi.4052 pod at\n2026-10-30 04:15 UTC before the tsdweb rollout: allauth account 0006-0009\n(lowercases stored emails) and oauth2_provider 0008-0022 (token_checksum\nbackfill). Old pods can't insert OAuth tokens after those, so the web\nrollout followed immediately; it finished 3.5 minutes later.\n\nApplied to the cluster 2026-10-30; the files match it.\n\ne08e85c\n(eval):1: ===== not found","sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"72b47207-7558-4897-9cb9-f774d14db280","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/ops/.claude/worktrees/credits-gateway-config","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
