T16:41:50.460Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/credits-onboarding","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
{"parentUuid":"ce508232-b0bf-4dc6-a132-96d06cc97eef","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"984766b3-abee-4a37-b61b-7bdc0139a255","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BSXWVBEAnyidsHGBFDx5Am","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_756f4482-e5c7-45b4-bc36-5e6db3b079ef/credits-onboarding-flags.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"dd8a864a-7ea0-4d88-ba82-173b57c9e8e0","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:41:50.487Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/kenneth/Library/Application Support/Claude/side-session-notes/local_756f4482-e5c7-45b4-bc36-5e6db3b079ef/credits-onboarding-flags.md","oldString":"- Fixed, uncommitted in the `credits-ledger` worktree. The gateway logged","newString":"- Fixed in `7c69f331be`. The gateway logged","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":22,"oldLines":7,"newStart":22,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," ## Found by the live local chats, 2026-11-02"," ","-- Fixed, uncommitted in the `credits-ledger` worktree. The gateway logged \"could not keep a chat request\" for every Standard request through OpenRouter, because `_keep_sync` in `web_ent/jusprin/v2/gateway.py` parsed every reply event as JSON and OpenRouter's documented stream ends in `data: [DONE]`. Kenneth chose a blind write: the request and events are stored as raw text, and branch files are gone, so a retry, edit or revert overwrites the earlier version. A test with a stream ending in `[DONE]` failed before the change and passes now; all 122 `jusprin.v2` tests pass. The real OpenRouter stream was not rerun.","+- Fixed in `7c69f331be`. The gateway logged \"could not keep a chat request\" for every Standard request through OpenRouter, because `_keep_sync` in `web_ent/jusprin/v2/gateway.py` parsed every reply event as JSON and OpenRouter's documented stream ends in `data: [DONE]`. Kenneth chose a blind write: the request and events are stored as raw text, and branch files are gone, so a retry, edit or revert overwrites the earlier version. A test with a stream ending in `[DONE]` failed before the change and passes now; all 122 `jusprin.v2` tests pass. The real OpenRouter stream was not rerun."," - Fixed, and this replaces item 3's example details above. The example no longer opens the OrcaSliced 3MF, which had three stacked objects, three filaments and a collision warning. It opens `resources/handy_models/3DBenchy.drc`. `resources/profiles` holds no printable model. The printer is now saved under its own name, \"Generic Klipper Printer\", the way normal printer setup does, so the chip shows no warning triangle or \"from the file\". There is no rule specific to onboarding. Real-app result on an empty data folder: one object, one filament, ~44 min, 12 g, $0.23, no print issue. Cost: Home shows a printer card \"Generic Klipper Printer, Not connected\"."," - Fixed. Choosing a printer on an empty project wrote change rows, and Home listed any empty project with rows, so a blank \"Untitled\" card appeared beside the opened file. `authored_head` in `Workspace/ProjectAutosave.cpp` no longer lists an empty project whose only history is printer, filament or process choices. A chat on an empty plate stays listed. The empty project's folder stays on disk, hidden. This applies to every path that picks a printer on an empty project, not only the example. Only the example path was run; that other paths left a blank card before is inferred from the code."," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ce508232-b0bf-4dc6-a132-96d06cc97eef","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/credits-onboarding","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
