{"parentUuid":"5c0d8853-82e3-473a-84d3-54370f267ffb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeSAWSSzZCjcvteycVWS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I committed all the work from this session, not just the gateway fix, since \"commit\" didn't name a part: four commits on three feature branches. Nothing is pushed, merged or deployed.\n\n| Repository | Branch | Commit | What it holds |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| JusPrin | `claude/credits-onboarding` | `48ec76705d` | Credits in the app and the first-run path on Home (90 files) |\n| tsd-enterprise | `claude/credits-ledger` | `a54316ceab` | Credit ledger, charging, `/account`, print report rewards |\n| tsd-enterprise | `claude/credits-ledger` | `7c69f331be` | Chats kept as raw text, no branch files (+35, −98) |\n| ops | `claude/credits-gateway-config` | `40ca1bc` | Standard model config, not applied to any cluster |\n\n- **Not committed:** `live-check-2026-11-02/` in the app worktree stays untracked, because it holds working screenshots.\n- **Testing:** the ledger commit `a54316ceab` wasn't tested on its own, because I split it from the raw-text commit by reversing that change's few lines. All 122 gateway tests pass with both commits together.\n- **Before deploying the gateway:** the `JUSPRIN_OPENROUTER_API_KEY` secret has to exist on `jusprin-v2-gateway-stg` and `jusprin-v2-gateway-prod`, or the pods won't start. The ops commit also has to go out with the gateway, which fails at startup without the new model settings. Both commit messages say this."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1823,"cache_read_input_tokens":285318,"output_tokens":530,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1823,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":530,"cache_read_input_tokens":285318,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1823,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1823},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgeSAW8baAQA6Z422BmAi","requestRef":"a7e20bbe-a3f7-46f3-817b-14573a76c3d1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"8d7cfd0b-1f7c-489c-b3e8-b81f1f2c493c","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:41:56.299Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/credits-onboarding","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
