 works: the full 3e row, or only the sentence (not drawn).\n292:Decided during the review (2026-11-02), so no longer here: a chat keeps its model; prices always say \"a message\"; the composer shows only a ring; a bar per expiring l\n?? pricing-implementation-plan-2026-11.md\nAgentUI/src/state/store.test.ts:179:      providers: [{ id: 'openai', label: 'OpenAI', defaultModel: 'gpt-5.4-mini', state: 'loading', models: [] }],\nAgent/AgentHost.cpp:2772:    if (!use_chat_model(conversation_id, by_person))\nAgent/AgentHost.cpp:3398:            // account is given now; use_chat_model() fixes it at the first.\nAgent/AgentHost.cpp:3454:        providers.push_back(json{{\"id\", provider}, {\"label\", profile->display_name}, {\"defaultModel\", profile->model},\nAgent/AgentHost.cpp:3551:bool AgentHost::use_chat_model(const std::string& conversation_id, bool by_person)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":true,"staleReadFileStateHint":"[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: ../../../../../../../pricing-implementation-plan-2026-11.md. Call Read before editing.]"},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"eba0420d-a043-4d5e-a5c1-0495686b3b00","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/credits-onboarding/src/slic3r/GUI/JusPrin","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"jusprin-newui","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
