{"parentUuid":"2d57c997-97ab-467e-8edb-771abde7b753","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6b3f9665-7f28-483d-84d9-db7ace5fe0b2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RRHrMi3j5EZVGJA5A6ypfC","type":"tool_result","content":"#!/bin/zsh\n# Blocks until the Agent page shows no running turn for 3 checks in a row, up to $1 seconds.\nP=$1; limit=$2; calm=0; started=0\nfor i in $(seq 1 $((limit/3))); do\n  sleep 3; $P/front.sh >/dev/null\n  busy=$(python3 $P/p.py agent \"(()=>{const b=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('button')).map(x=>x.getAttribute('aria-label')||x.innerText.trim());return b.some(t=>/^Stop/i.test(t))?'busy':'idle'})()\" 5)\n  if [ \"$busy\" = busy ]; then started=1; calm=0; else calm=$((calm+1)); fi\n  [ $calm -ge 3 ] && [ $started = 1 -o $i -gt 10 ] && break\ndone\necho \"after $((i*3))s started=$started state=$busy\"\npicked\nBack to chats | New chat | Chat actions | Hide the Agent panel | All settings | Compute estimates | Printer quality test | Just a fun print | Print it as is | Attach a file | Model: Standard | Credits left | Send message [disabled]\nPrint it as is. Which layer height am I on?\nsent\nafter 15s started=1 state=idle\n.20mm Standard @MyKlipper\" profile, and the first layer is also 0.2 mm. Height of the boat is 48 mm, so expect about 240 layers, roughly 1 hour at normal speeds.\n\nI left everything else as it was: 3 walls, 15% infill, no supports. I've started slicing so I can check the result before you print; I'll report what it says when it finishes.\n\nWant me to open the send dialog once the slice checks out?\nYes, open it\nNot yet\nSlicing plate 1\nplate 1:Generating infill regions · 25%\nCancel\n\n\n\nStandard\n\nSend\n{'total': 499, 'lots': [{'kind': 'signup', 'credits': 499, 'granted': 500, 'expires_at': '2026-12-02T18:36:17.014148+00:00'}]}\n{'basic_turns': 1, 'expert_turns': 1, 'credits': 1}\n[{'date': '2026-11-02', 'chat_id': 'f411241cd9c0624784c8069b6f7c9385', 'tier': 'basic', 'messages': 1