{"parentUuid":"9ed39861-a490-42bc-b2c7-75f2ff8e5390","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgecQuDDR2GSeWghvpW75","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 11 credit rules are applied in the three worktrees (app, gateway, deploy config), and the three live chats charged correctly. Nothing new is committed: these changes sit uncommitted on top of the earlier commits. One new bug is still open: Standard chats can show a red error about the chat title.\n\n## Problem\nKenneth changed the rules after reviewing the boards: one kind of credit, no Workshop ceiling, expiry one month from each grant, and balances shown only in credits. The three live chats had to test the final rules.\n\n## Solution\n- **Gateway:** every lot is now an ordinary credit lot. The free 50 is granted lazily, only after the first month and only to accounts without a subscription. Standard costs 0 on an active Workshop plan.\n- **App:** balances are one number, each lot gets a bar, and \"New Standard chat\" is gone. A new chat starts on Standard after the first month, and Standard has no thinking picker.\n- **Plan doc:** the body now matches its decision block, and it stays untracked.\n\nThe live run found two bugs, both fixed:\n- **Launch crash:** a Standard model with no effort made `/models` send `default_effort: null`, and the app crashed reading it. The gateway now leaves the key out.\n- **Model menu:** the two-line Standard and Expert rows overlapped because of a fixed row height.\n\n## Tests\n- **Suites:**\n  - Gateway: 133 pass.\n  - Agent page: 654 pass, rerun after the menu fix.\n  - Home page: 130 pass.\n  - Native: agent bridge 506, JusPrin 151, shell theme 14; the shell harness exits 0.\n- **Live chats:** these ran on the local gateway with real keys, because Kenneth had said \"Not yet\" to deploying to staging. Spend was about $0.25, assuming list prices for Sonnet.\n\n| Chat | Credits | Balance after |\n|---|---|---|\n| Free Expert turn when a file opens | 0 | 500 |\n| Standard message, no effort sent | 1 | 499 |\n| Expert message | 5 | 494 |\n| Standard message on a seeded Workshop account | 0 | 640 |\n\n- **Screens:** I sent 9 real-app screenshots. Those for later balances use amounts seeded in the local database. The printer warning triangle in them comes from my scratch data folder.\n\n## Remaining\n- **Open bug:** the red error \"The automatic chat title could not be generated\" appeared once in the Standard chat.\n  - In direct tries of the same request, Standard answered the question instead of writing a title, and 4 of 12 replies were too long to accept. The live reply wasn't recorded, so its cause is inferred from those tries.\n  - Titles never send effort, so removing Standard's effort did not cause this.\n  - My pick is to fall back to the start of the person's message, which needs no model call.\n- **Decisions I followed or filled in; Kenneth should confirm:**\n  - Rule 10 says \"50 free credits this month\", but the manifest records him removing that line, so I showed only the ring.\n  - The low-balance notice appears at 5 messages' worth or less, rounded to the nearest 5.\n  - Two bought packs share one bar.\n  - v1 subscribers don't get the free 50.\n  - Report rewards are still placeholders, and clawback now draws from every lot.\n- **Background cost:** after a Standard message starts a slice, the app's follow-up turn runs on Expert at 0 credits, so we pay Expert prices for it.\n- **Not built:** the pricing page, the savings alert and the Account switch belong to later steps, so only the plan doc changed for them.\n- **Not exercised:** real billing, the failed-send card outside Vitest, Windows, Linux and dark mode.\n\nFull details are in the shared notes file `credits-onboarding-flags.md`, and the screenshots are in `live-check-2026-11-02/` in the app worktree."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1378,"cache_read_input_tokens":220608,"output_tokens":1303,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1378,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1303,"cache_read_input_tokens":220608,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1378,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1378},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgecQtfEoo1rNu412WV88","requestRef":"37fe6fb6-8a57-4254-85f1-10d5ccffbf18","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"07baadf9-afee-49df-88c8-d80a58f09089","timestamp":"2026-11-02T18:56:27.071Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/credits-onboarding","sessionId":"f57d8b7e-fd5a-4daf-9378-2e3d21342f7c","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/credits-onboarding","slug":"temporal-enchanting-muffin"}
